id=ct_ims_autoinject
name=China Telecom IMS Auto-Inject
version=v2.3
versionCode=6
author=ifchy
description=Boot: re-applies China Telecom (中国电信) VoLTE/VoNR/VoWiFi/VT carrier-config + restarts IMS (headless, root, no app needed) — CT SIM1 only, never auto-touches T-Mobile. Tap "Action" to manually enable T-Mobile cross-SIM calling (备用通话) over CT data (sets crossSimCallingEnabled=1 + WFC, no cellular block).
